The bug was caused by a NullPointerException (NPE) occurring in the `LiteWorkflowAppParser` class when a SubWorkflow action included the `propagate-configuration` element but did not have a corresponding global section. The absence of the global section meant that the variable `gData` was null, leading to the NPE when the code attempted to access it without checking for nullity.

